nstantly capturing Touma's attention. With his interest piqued, Touma ambitiously asks Maki to join the boys' team but is quickly rejected, as Maki doesn't wish to join any clubs. Touma refuses to back down and ends up persuading Maki—only under the condition that Touma will pay him for his participation and cover other club expenses.\n\nMaki joins the team, and his incredible form and quick learning allow him to immediately outshine the rest of the team. Although this gives rise to conflict among the boys, Maki challenges and pushes his fellow team members to not only keep up with his seemingly natural talent, but also drive them to devote themselves to the game they once neglected.\n\nAs the members of the boys' soft tennis club discover their own capabilities, they endure personal hardships and deal with the darker side of growing up in middle school.\n\n(Source: MAL Rewrite)"},"tags":[{"name":"Coming of Age","rank":93,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Tennis","rank":91,"spoiler":false},{"name":"School Club","rank":91,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Primarily Male Cast","rank":85,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Family Life","rank":85,"spoiler":false},{"name":"School","rank":78,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Male Protagonist","rank":78,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Primarily Teen Cast","rank":73,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Bullying","rank":68,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Primarily Child Cast","rank":67,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Revenge","rank":66,"spoiler":true},{"name":"LGBTQ+ Themes","rank":66,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Ensemble Cast","rank":64,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Transgender","rank":53,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Adoption","rank":46,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Crossdressing","rank":38,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Twins","rank":33,"spoiler":false}],"titles":{"display":"Stars Align","english":"Stars Align","native":"星合の空","romaji":"Hoshiai no Sora","synonyms":[{"language":"ja","source":"bangumi","value":"星合の空 -ほしあいのそら-"},{"language":"zh","source":"bangumi","value":"星合之空"}]},"trailer":{"id":"3HF5qamje